{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04134","headline":"题东山子李适碑阴二首 一 · 徐彦伯","name":"题东山子李适碑阴二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陇嶂萦紫气，金光赫氛氲。\n美人含遥霭，桃李芳自薰。\n图高黄鹤羽，宝夺骊龙羣。\n忽惊薤露曲，掩噎东山云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}